// A call may wait, and a type does not: `@sysl` on a handle's class takes no `blocking`, so the
// class is not a handle and its method has no body.
// error: `@sysl` on a class takes one string, the module and name of the Sysl type it is a handle on
// error: `sign` has no body; only an abstract class may leave a method without one

@sysl("sysl.math.bigint.BigInt", blocking)
class BigInt
  sign() -> int

main() = 0
